+## Component catalog
+
+`apps/react-vite` keeps a local component catalog (`component-catalog.config.json`, generated `component-catalog.json`) for `src/components/ui` and `src/features/*/components`. After adding, removing or changing an exported component in those directories, run from `apps/react-vite`:
+
+```bash
+pnpm run catalog:generate   # refresh component-catalog.json
+pnpm run catalog:check      # verify enrollment, metadata and freshness
+```
+
+`pnpm run check` runs the type check followed by the catalog check, and is the routine verification command.
+
 ## Setup Commands
 
